    "title": "Maximum Length Concatenated String with Unique Characters",
    "category": "Recursion",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Given an array of strings, choose any subset of strings such that the concatenated string contains only unique characters. Return the maximum possible length of such a concatenated string.",
